---
import {homeBlocks} from '../../lib/home-page.mjs';
const b=homeBlocks();
---
<section class="hp-section hp-start" id="try" aria-labelledby="hp-start-title"><div class="wrap">
 <div class="hp-section-head"><p class="hp-label">Get started</p><h2 id="hp-start-title">Run it. Ask one question.</h2><p>Choose where the model runs, start the server, then send your first decision request.</p></div>
 <div class="hp-start-grid"><div class="gs" data-tabs><div class="gs__tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Where to run the model">{b.tabs.map((t,i)=><button type="button" role="tab" id={`gs-${t.id}`} aria-controls={`gsp-${t.id}`} aria-selected={String(i===0)} tabindex={i===0?0:-1}>{t.label}</button>)}</div>
 {b.tabs.map((t,i)=><div class:list={['gs__panel',{on:i===0}]} role="tabpanel" id={`gsp-${t.id}`} aria-labelledby={`gs-${t.id}`}><p class="hp-setup-note">{t.note}</p>{t.blocks.map((code,n)=><div class="hp-code" data-copy-text={code}><pre tabindex="0" aria-label={`${t.label}: ${n===0?'start':'request'}`}><code>{code}</code></pre><button type="button" data-copy-box hidden>Copy</button></div>)}<p class="hp-setup-link"><a href={t.href}>{t.guide}</a>{t.id==='gpu'&&<> · <a href="/docs/deploy/docker/">GPU with Docker</a></>}</p></div>)}
 </div><div class="hp-first-request" id="ask"><h3>Send a choice request</h3><p>For the GPU or MLX server on port 8000. For Ollama, use its model-specific request in the Ollama tab.</p><div class="hp-code" data-copy-text={b.request}><pre tabindex="0" aria-label="First choice request"><code>{b.request}</code></pre><button type="button" data-copy-box hidden>Copy</button></div><p>The returned <code>answers.category</code> contains the chosen category and a probability for every option. <a href="/docs/concepts/choice/">Read the response fields</a>.</p></div></div>
 <noscript><p><a href="/docs/deploy/cloud-gpu/">GPU guide</a> · <a href="/docs/deploy/mac/">MLX guide</a> · <a href="/docs/deploy/mac/#on-a-laptop-with-ollama">Ollama guide</a></p></noscript>
 <div class="hp-start-bottom"><p><a href="/docs/use-from/">Use Python, JavaScript or TypeScript</a></p><p><a href="/docs/ai-skills/">Let your coding agent set it up</a></p><a class="button button--primary" href="/docs/">Follow the getting-started guide</a></div>
</div></section>
